<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 01.700  Butterfly Ring of Fire. Opt.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">Designed by J Hamer. December 2014.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Copyright assigned to the public domain.</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.540</tspan>
